  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elihu continued:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Bear with me a little longer and I will show you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that there is more to be said in God's behalf.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I get my knowledge from afar;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will ascribe justice to my Maker.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be assured that my words are not false;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "one who has perfect knowledge is with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"God is mighty, but despises no one;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he is mighty, and firm in his purpose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He does not keep the wicked alive",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but gives the afflicted their rights.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He does not take his eyes off the righteous;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he enthrones them with kings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and exalts them forever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if people are bound in chains,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "held fast by cords of affliction,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he tells them what they have done—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that they have sinned arrogantly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He makes them listen to correction",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and commands them to repent of their evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If they obey and serve him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they will spend the rest of their days in prosperity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and their years in contentment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if they do not listen,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they will perish by the sword",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and die without knowledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The godless in heart harbor resentment;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "even when he fetters them, they do not cry for help.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They die in their youth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "among male prostitutes of the shrines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But those who suffer he delivers in their suffering;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he speaks to them in their affliction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He is wooing you from the jaws of distress",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to a spacious place free from restriction,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to the comfort of your table laden with choice food.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now you are laden with the judgment due the wicked;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "judgment and justice have taken hold of you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be careful that no one entices you by riches;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "do not let a large bribe turn you aside.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Would your wealth or even all your mighty efforts",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "sustain you so you would not be in distress?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not long for the night,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to drag people away from their homes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beware of turning to evil,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "which you seem to prefer to affliction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"God is exalted in his power.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who is a teacher like him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who has prescribed his ways for him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or said to him, 'You have done wrong'?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember to extol his work,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "which people have praised in song.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All humanity has seen it;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mortals gaze on it from afar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How great is God—beyond our understanding!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The number of his years is past finding out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He draws up the drops of water,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "which distill as rain to the streams",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ";",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the clouds pour down their moisture",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and abundant showers fall on mankind.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who can understand how he spreads out the clouds,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "how he thunders from his pavilion?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "See how he scatters his lightning about him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "bathing the depths of the sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the way he governs",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the nations",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and provides food in abundance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He fills his hands with lightning",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and commands it to strike its mark.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His thunder announces the coming storm;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 36:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "even the cattle make known its approach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.36.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
